  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Stronger Universities Phase IV (2023-2028)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to 1) improved quality of research-based tertiary education within selected thematic areas leading to high-quality graduates who will contribute to society through relevant employment; 2) more and better quality research from the three African universities which contributes to knowledge of particular relevance to sustainable development nationally, in Africa and globally; and 3) increased use of results from applied research by both public and private stakeholders in the three countries.</narrative>
  </description>
